  "design": {
    "method": "Definitive screening",
    "notes": [
      "Definitive screening design: 15 runs for 6 factors (conference matrix of order 6).",
      "Main effects are orthogonal to each other and to all two-factor interactions and quadratic effects.",
      "Use stepwise selection to identify active quadratic and interaction terms.",
      "Categorical factors take alternating levels where continuous factors are at their center.",
      "Environmental factors (Joint gap, Ambient humidity) are not set by the design; record their measured values for each run. The analysis includes them as covariates."
